                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Rn1Hs",
                              "name": "Joanne!! Aww I'm sad to see you go :( :(",
                              "context": "span",
                              "fill": "#2b1f22",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Joanne!! Aww I'm sad to see you go :( :( but am so happy for you with your new role! You've been awesome to work with and I've truly learnt a lot from you. Glad we got to hustleee accountancy together w Maggie (it's a never-ending one lol), couldn't have had that over the line without all your work. You should be super confident & proud, people in your next role are v lucky to have you! All the best Joanne & stay in touch please, maybe I'll swing over to Singapore sometime omw to NZ and can catch you & the others then! WhatsApp: +64211442378",
                              "lineHeight": 1.45,
                              "fontFamily": "Figtree",
                              "fontSize": 24,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
