                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "gZnHz",
                              "name": "Dearest Joanne, What a lovely year of kn",
                              "context": "span",
                              "fill": "#2b1f22",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 499.67,
                              "content": "Dearest Joanne, What a lovely year of knowing you! You brought so much joy and energy into the Singapore Office and 423. We will all miss you and your chic pashmina. Wishing you all the success and joy not only in your new role but in life. Keep in touch and remember you will always be an OG of 423!",
